ji-106","chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p007","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m007-0069","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/106.json"}],"interpretation_note":"只記本段實際死亡。未明死因者不補自殺；不以死亡終止全部官爵，不把時長當月名。吳太子僅孝文時，不補確切年；齊王早置發兵段的敘次與052不同，兩篇原文分存。未核書影。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"normalized_date_range":{"earliest":{"era":"BCE","era_year":155,"year":-154},"latest":{"era":"BCE","era_year":154,"year":-153},"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year_range","basis":"regnal_year_crosses_ce_year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"諸侯既新削罰，振恐，多怨晁錯。及削吳會稽、豫章郡書至，則吳王先起兵，膠西正月丙午誅漢吏二千石以下，膠東、菑川、濟南、楚、趙亦然，遂發兵西。齊王後悔，飲藥自殺，畔約。濟北王城壞未完，其郎中令劫守其王，不得發兵。膠西為渠率，膠東、菑川、濟南共攻圍臨菑。趙王遂亦反，陰使匈奴與連兵。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-106","chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p007","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m007-0069","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/106.json"}],"references":[{"title":"將相表紀年對照","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"孝景元年","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r051-c01","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false},{"title":"將相表紀年對照","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"三","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r053-c01","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false},{"title":"將相表紀年對照","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"154","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r053-c00","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記曆書》索隱·太初改歲首","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記三家註/卷026&oldid=2514838","quote":"然漢始以建亥爲年首，今改以建寅，故以七年爲元年。","scope":"received_calendar_rule","text_layer":"suoyin_commentary","revision_id":2514838,"image_verified":false},{"title":"同篇七國發